 "title": "Leakage of related rows across dataset splits",
 "purpose": "Find groups of related rows (a prompt cluster, a lineage family, a source document) whose rows fall in more than one of the train, validation and test splits, with the splits and row counts of each leaking group, so held-out scores are not inflated by near-copies.",
 "form": "function",
 "asset_role": null,
